@startuml
hide footbox
participant "TransactionDialog" as p0
participant "TransactionService" as p1
participant "JdbcCategoryDao" as p2
participant "JDBC / SQLite" as p3
p0 -> p1: addExpense(userId, categoryId, amount, date, ...)
p1 -> p2: findById(categoryId)
p2 --> p1: Optional<Category>
p1 -> p1: validateExpense(...)
p1 -> p3: getConnection(); setAutoCommit(false)
p1 -> p3: INSERT transactions; generated key
p1 -> p3: commit()
p1 --> p0: Expense with generated id
note over p0: TransactionService inserts expenses directly; the failure branch rolls back.
@enduml